{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"時事全方位｜打擊及防範詐騙(一)\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/2026-11-13-14-04-40vdHF5pK5.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】題目：打擊及防範詐騙</p><p>近日接連有航空公司及商戶資料外洩，市民隨後懷疑被騙徒假冒客服詐騙，警方有甚麼打撃措施？市民應如何防範？</p><p>嘉賓：商業罪案調查科反詐騙協調中心警司李蔚詩</p><p></p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T06:57:31.306097+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":93,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T06:45:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T14:56:29.623723+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T06:51:01.825174+00:00","content_hash":"dc45d3104d59908a014167c5d3e8e5a332c355cb22b2152559b9d1624af1ecbd","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-13T06:57:31.306097+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}